          "source_element_id": null,
          "source_refs": [
            "http://classic.net.bible.org/verse.php?book=1Jo&chapter=2&verse=3"
          ],
          "text": "ወበእንተዝ፡ ነአምር፡ ከመ፡ አእመርናሁ፡ ለእመ፡ ዐቀብነ፡ ትእዛዞ።"
        },
        {
          "number": 5,
          "unit_order": 5,
          "source_marker": "4",
          "source_element_id": null,
          "source_refs": [
            "http://classic.net.bible.org/verse.php?book=1Jo&chapter=2&verse=4"
          ],
          "text": "ወዘሰ፡ ይብል፡ አአምሮ፡ ወኢየዐቅብ፡ ትእዛዞ፡ ሐሳዊ፡ ውእቱ። ወአልቦ፡ ጽድቀ፡ እግዚአብሔር፡ በኀቤሁ።"
        },
        {
