          "unit_order": 6,
          "source_marker": "5",
          "source_element_id": null,
          "source_refs": [
            "http://classic.net.bible.org/verse.php?book=1Jo&chapter=2&verse=5"
          ],
          "text": "ወዘሰ፡ የዐቅብ፡ ቃሎ፡ አማን፡ ፍቅረ፡ እግዚአብሔር፡ ፍጹም፡ ላዕሌሁ። ወበዝንቱ፡ ነአምር፡ ከመ፡ ቦቱ፡ ሀለውነ።"
        },
        {
          "number": 7,
          "unit_order": 7,
          "source_marker": "6",
          "source_element_id": null,
          "source_refs": [
            "http://classic.net.bible.org/verse.php?book=1Jo&chapter=2&verse=6"
          ],
          "text": "ወዘሰ፡ ይብል፡ ቦቱ፡ ሀለውኩ፡ መፍትው፡ ይሑር፡ በከመ፡ ሖረ፡ ዝክቱ።"
        },
        {
          "number": 8,
          "unit_order": 8,
          "source_marker": null,
          "source_element_id": null,
          "source_refs": [],
          "text": "በእንተ፡ ዘበአማን፡ ብርሃን"
