          "unit_order": 5,
          "source_marker": "4",
          "source_element_id": null,
          "source_refs": [
            "http://classic.net.bible.org/verse.php?book=1Jo&chapter=3&verse=4"
          ],
          "text": "ወኵሉ፡ ዘይገብራ፡ ለኀጢአት፡ ወለአበሳኒ፡ ገብራ፡ ውእቱ። እስመ፡ ኀጢአት፡ አበሳ፡ ይእቲ።"
        },
        {
          "number": 6,
          "unit_order": 6,
          "source_marker": "5",
          "source_element_id": null,
          "source_refs": [
            "http://classic.net.bible.org/verse.php?book=1Jo&chapter=3&verse=5"
          ],
          "text": "ወተአምሩ፡ ከመ፡ አስተርአየ፡ ዝክቱ፡ ከመ፡ ያሰስላ፡ ለኀጢአት። ወኀጢአትሰ፡ አልቦ፡ ኀቤሁ።"
        },
        {
          "number": 7,
          "unit_order": 7,
          "source_marker": "6",
          "source_element_id": null,
          "source_refs": [
            "http://classic.net.bible.org/verse.php?book=1Jo&chapter=3&verse=6"
          ],
          "text": "ወኵሉ፡ ዘቦቱ፡ ይነብር፡ ኢይኤብስ። እስመ፡ ኵሉ፡ ዘይኤብስ፡ ኢይሬእዮ፡ ወኢየአምሮ።"
        },
        {
          "number": 8,
          "unit_order": 8,
          "source_marker": null,
          "source_element_id": null,
          "source_refs": [],
          "text": "በእንተ፡ ተመስሎተ፡ እግዚእ"
        },
        {
          "number": 9,
          "unit_order": 9,
          "source_marker": "7",
          "source_element_id": null,
          "source_refs": [
            "http://classic.net.bible.org/verse.php?book=1Jo&chapter=3&verse=7"
          ],
          "text": "ደቂቅየ፡ ኢያስሕቱክሙ። ወኵሉ፡ ዘይገብራ፡ ለጽድቅ፡ ጻድቅ፡ ውእቱ። በከመ፡ ዝክቱ፡ ጻድቅ፡ ውእቱ።"
        },
        {
