          "number": 22,
          "unit_order": 22,
          "source_marker": "18",
          "source_element_id": null,
          "source_refs": [
            "http://classic.net.bible.org/verse.php?book=1Jo&chapter=3&verse=18"
          ],
          "text": "ደቂቅየ፡ ኢንትፋቀር፡ በቃል፡ ወበልሳን፡ ዘእንበለ፡ በምግባር፡ ወበጽድቅ።"
        },
        {
          "number": 23,
          "unit_order": 23,
          "source_marker": "19",
          "source_element_id": null,
          "source_refs": [
            "http://classic.net.bible.org/verse.php?book=1Jo&chapter=3&verse=19"
          ],
          "text": "ወበዝንቱ፡ ነአምር፡ ከመ፡ እምጽድቅ፡ ንሕነ። ወንሕነሰ፡ ቅድሜሁ፡ ናመክሮ፡ ለልብነ።"
        },
        {
          "number": 24,
          "unit_order": 24,
          "source_marker": "20",
          "source_element_id": null,
          "source_refs": [
            "http://classic.net.bible.org/verse.php?book=1Jo&chapter=3&verse=20"
          ],
          "text": "ወእመሰ፡ ያርሰሐስሐነ፡ ልብነ፡ እምአበሳነ። ያዐብዮ፡ እግዚአብሔር፡ ለልብነ፡ ወየአምር፡ ኵሎ።"
        },
        {
          "number": 25,
          "unit_order": 25,
          "source_marker": "21",
          "source_element_id": null,
          "source_refs": [
            "http://classic.net.bible.org/verse.php?book=1Jo&chapter=3&verse=21"
          ],
          "text": "አኀዊነ፡ እመሰ፡ ኢቀለየነ፡ ልብነ፡ ገጽ፡ ብነ፡ ኀበ፡ እግዚአብሔር።"
        },
